IT:
Grazie per la nostra chiacchierata
l'altro giorno.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi hai aiutato
a schiarirmi le idee.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}E così finalmente ho deciso!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Mi trasferisco!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Grazie di tutto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}} Odio gli addii,
quindi il nostro sarà un arrivederci.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000E:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:9600}}Arrivederci!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}

DE:
Danke für deinen guten Rat neulich!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das war echt nett von dir.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Jetzt hab ich mich endlich
entschieden:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich zieh weg!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Danke für alles, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
Irgendwann werden wir uns wieder-
sehen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mach's gut...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:000E:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:9600}}Buhuuu!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I finally made up my mind!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
I'm moving out of this town!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I went back and forth so much
that eventually I just flipped a coin
for it, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I hope I'll see you again,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Finalmente ho deciso!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Me ne vado da questa città!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ero così indeciso che alla fine
ho dovuto fare testa o croce,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Spero di rivederti presto,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
Welcome to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm glad I got to talk with you{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
before I move away.
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} is a great place,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} so you
should still come to visit even after
I'm gone,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Estás de visita?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Encantado!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Me llamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Es una pena que nos conozcamos
justo ahora.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mañana me mudo a
otro pueblo, ¿sabes?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Aunque igual nos volvemos a
encontrar en alguna parte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Purtroppo oggi ho poco tempo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sai com'è: trasloco domani!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Solo che non so ancora dove{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ehm,
non ho ancora deciso, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Vieni nella mia città!
Schiarisciti le idee...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Whoa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} now here's a new face!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nice to meet you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I'd love to stop and chat with you,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but I'm moving away tomorrow,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} so
I've got to finish packing!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'd invite you to visit me in my 
new town,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but I haven't decided
where I'm going yet{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
So I guess this is good-bye forever?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Come to my town!
We'll meet again!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ehi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} una faccia nuova!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Piacere di conoscerti!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Vorrei tanto fermarmi a fare
due chiacchiere,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma trasloco
domani{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} e sono impegnatissimo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ti direi di venirmi a trovare
nella mia nuova città,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma non
ho ancora deciso quale sarà{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
Beh, è il caso di dirci addio, no?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Vieni nella mia città!
Sì, addio!

