EN:
I was moving furniture around,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and I found some candy!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}Uh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's my lucky day, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
